"_comment":[
"Candidate model names for scripts/story_prop_inventory.py --library: a first, lexical",
"estimate of how many story props a CC0 3D library could cover. Names only, no assets.",
"Quaternius (CC0): pack contents as indexed by the npm package @jgengine/assets 0.59.0.",
"Kenney (CC0): file names from the manifest of the npm package @netforge/asset-library.",
"Both are third-party mirrors: confirm each model and its licence on quaternius.com and",
"kenney.nl before it enters the library. See docs/story-mode-3d-assets.md section 11.",
"Off-theme packs (sci-fi, space, weapons, monsters, dinosaurs, dungeon) are left out."
],
